---
// The bar that appears when the device loses its signal, saying that what is
// on screen came from storage and when it was stored.
//
// It is in the markup on every page and hidden until it is true: a bar that
// has to be created before it can be shown is a bar that arrives after the
// reader has already drawn their own conclusion about the empty page.
//
// role="status" rather than "alert": losing signal is worth announcing, not
// worth interrupting whatever the reader was in the middle of hearing.
---

<p class="offline-bar" data-offline-notice role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
